# Ta D2_LJ, Cut_Dummy at RCUT2B 6.5, M_KRR Kern_Linear, fitted to the
# energies of the docs quickstart dataset: the Quick Start potential that
# Tadah! 1.6.0 shipped (docs/source/quickstart/pot.tadah of that release;
# the quickstart now ships a D2_Blip + DM_mBlipEnv model). A linear,
# single-species, pure two-body potential: it takes the pair-collapse fast path.
ATOM     Ta
BIAS     false
DIMER     false     0     false
EWEIGHT     1.0
FWEIGHT     1.0
INIT2B     true
INITMB     false
LAMBDA     0
MODEL     M_KRR     Kern_Linear     1
NORM     false
OALGO     1
RCTYPE2B     Cut_Dummy
RCUT2B     6.5
SWEIGHT     1.0
TYPE2B     D2_LJ     Ta     Ta
UNCERTAINTY     false
WATOM     73
WEIGHTS     14.204213349318765225     2604.396965191186154698

